### Critical: [tests/setup.tsx](file:///e:/03-Code/Projects/Legacy/DocsSense/frontend/tests/setup.tsx)

4-step setup sequence:

```
STEP 1: @testing-library/jest-dom/vitest → DOM matchers (toBeInTheDocument, toHaveClass)
STEP 2: HTMLCanvasElement.getContext mock → Prevents Chart.js crash in jsdom
STEP 3: vi.mock("next/navigation|image|link") → Replaces Next.js internals with plain HTML
STEP 4: MSW server.listen() / resetHandlers() / close() → API interception lifecycle
```

