## Self-Corrections During Verification

| Issue | Root Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| esbuild JSX parse error | `setup.ts` contains JSX but has `.ts` extension | Renamed to `setup.tsx`, updated vitest config |
| `screen.getByAlt` not a function | RTL has `getByAltText`, not `getByAlt` | Fixed in DocCard + NavBar tests |
| Health test import path | Tests at `tests/unit/components/` need `../../mocks/`, not `../../../` | Fixed relative paths |
| UploadPage `require("../../setup")` fails | Setup renamed to `.tsx`, `require()` can't resolve | Replaced with `await import("next/navigation")` and `vi.fn()` cast |

