## How to Run

### Component Unit Tests (Vitest)
```bash
cd frontend
npm run test:unit     # verbose output
npm run test:watch    # watch mode for development
```

### E2E Tests (Playwright)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Before running Playwright E2E tests, you must install the headless browsers:
> ```bash
> npx playwright install
> ```

```bash
cd frontend
npm run test:e2e
```

Playwright will auto-start the Next.js dev server on `localhost:3000`.
